    description: "Concept audit 2026-10-21/22 (pinned dev e9215548f6; write-up ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/concept_audit_10212026/concept-audit-vocabulary-since-0923_10222026.md). F4, agent read: taint.py:1819 accepts any trust_level; only an exact 'trusted' has an effect (taint.py:313), so 'Trusted' or YAML true silently does nothing. TaintSink has no community flag, so a provenance: community sink file with trust_level: trusted is honoured and the disclosure credits 'the project's catalogue' (verify_claims.py:6229); spec docs/hypergumbo-spec.md:1045 says only --taint-sinks / extra_catalogs count; ADR-0061 ruling 2 says a community row may never make a verdict cleaner. Fix: validate the value (bounded enum); withhold trusted from community files and name it. Repro end to end first (agent did not)."  # f972
